     2852: /* The following must be called before anything else to get the encoding set up
     2853:  * on the modifier.  In particular it must be called before the transform init
     2854:  * functions are called.
     2855:  */
     2856: static void
     2857: modifier_set_encoding(png_modifier *pm)
     2858: {
```

The reproducer will be compiled with:
  clang -fsanitize=address -g -O0 -I/tmp/libpng_upstream reproducer.c -L/tmp/libpng_upstream/build/.libs -ltiff -lm

The project source root is: /tmp/libpng_upstream
